From 6db6450228dfa4714e4f945b4a34f050d7e5f4e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: milliluk-erik <build@localhost>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 12:41:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 41/49] symbols: -symbols FILE, @Name wherever an address is,

The sym: stop-reply pair rides the every-machine T packet, so a Dragon
stop is symbolized too: the reverse lookup keys on the physical PC,
which on a flat machine is the logical PC by the same degrade the rest
of the fork uses.
---
